push ends. Survival is not guaranteed, and your squad is your lifeline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Your Robots Fight Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/037cf8d194f42bb37cd0c00f4f08bc2f.poster.avif?t=1786094312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/037cf8d194f42bb37cd0c00f4f08bc2f.webm?t=1786094312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/037cf8d194f42bb37cd0c00f4f08bc2f.mp4?t=1786094312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squad can be built around different combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build for long combos and stylish air control. Build for timed counters and quick reactions. Build around armor, lifesteal, heavy hits, ability rotations, or raw pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap in anime-inspired attacks like rising launchers, meteor kicks, and super beams. Equip parts that change how blocking, dashing, attacking, and surviving work. Replace a block with a parry. Trade a dash for a roll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amplify the effects, tune the impact, paint your robots, and give them names before sending them back into the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/b5e0b701949120226baa06d831eb8781.poster.avif?t=1786094312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/b5e0b701949120226baa06d831eb8781.webm?t=1786094312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/b5e0b701949120226baa06d831eb8781.mp4?t=1786094312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Ironweld is a 2D side-scrolling action RPG where every encounter feels like PvP. Survive opponents that use the same moves and parts as you. They chase, punish, launch, and pressure you back. Repair and rebuild your squad between stages as you push deeper. Lose them all and it's over.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/095ac93e8d96657e4df1f6cfa6b2333dd7c68d19/header.jpg?t=1786094312", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/9e78bb4e79dc846692bc3bdc900bc0bab90b43cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786094312", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/9e78bb4e79dc846692bc3bdc900bc0bab90b43cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786094312", "website": "https://2071games.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core CPU @ 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU with OpenGL ES 3.0 support and 2 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated Sound Card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core CPU @ 2.5 GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU with OpenGL ES 3.0 support and 4 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated Sound Card</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["2071 Games"], "publishers": ["2071 Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 3796850, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/cab7001eb55681e6b6e2ad1a715013f596025c72/ss_cab7001eb55681e6b6e2ad1a715013f596025c72.600x338.jpg?t=1786094312", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/cab7001eb55681e6b6e2ad1a715013f596025c72/ss_cab7001eb55681e6b6e2ad1a715013f596025c72.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786094312"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/d0092238d85435a134eb646e04ec10d569fc4191/ss_d0092238d85435a134eb646e04ec10d569fc4191.600x338.jpg?t=1786094312", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/d0092238d85435a134eb646e04ec10d569fc4191/ss_d0092238d85435a134eb646e04ec10d569fc4191.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786094312"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/a1b205f831d921e5768cf36be797b5f3380824e6/ss_a1b205f831d921e5768cf36be797b5f3380824e6.600x338.jpg?t=1786094312", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/a1b205f831d921e5768cf36be7